 my mother used to say, when I\u2019d say \u201cthere\u2019s too much noise ...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q16985$5D48D65A-26A0-4E23-A4C7-32323E558C0B", "rank": "normal"}]}}